    <preface>
      <p>Industrial Chemicals Environmental Management (Register) Charge (Customs) Act 2021</p>
      <p>No. 28, 2021</p>
      <p>An Act to impose charge on registered introducers of industrial chemicals, so far as that charge is a duty of customs, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p><ref href="#part-1">Part 1</ref>—Preliminary	2</p>
      <p>1	Short title	2</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
