      <p>4	Extension to external Territories	3</p>
      <p>5	Act does not impose tax on property of a State	3</p>
      <p>6	Definitions	3</p>
      <p><ref href="#part-2">Part 2</ref>—Charge	4</p>
      <p>7	Imposition of charge	4</p>
      <p>8	Amount of charge	4</p>
